+    $$ y_i = y_f v_i \quad (\text{for R/SMC}) $$
+5.  **Inverse Opacity (Ray Distance):** Solve for the ray distance $t_i$ such that the cumulative opacity equals $y_i$:
+    $$ F_r(t_i) = y_i \implies t_i = F_r^{-1}(y_i) $$
